    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah i know ppl say help is out there but it doesnt feel like it matters. it's like i've tried every thing. every \"strategy\" and every \"tool\" they give you. it's just more stuff to do. more things to manage. i'm just so drained from the constant effort of existing. it's not even sadness anymore, it's just... i'm finished. i'm just done.",
